    "turn_idx": 25,
    "turn_text": "or did you stay? Well, we had a wonderful discussion during the meeting. I told Dr. King I needed his help. I wanted to attend Troy State College, all my school, not known as Troy University, that I have submitted my application, my high school transcript. But I never heard a word from the college. So Dr. King said, I know your family owns some land. I said, yes, it's 110 acres. And we have a house on the land where we live. He said, you know, if you pursue your entrance and going to church state, your home could be bombed or burned. your family could lose the land, go back and have a discussion with your mother and father. And, but if you want to go, we will help you. We will sue the state of Alabama. We will sue Troy State. And we would get other lawyers like Freer Gray and Thurgood Moistures and others to help. And I went back and had a discussion with my mother and my father.",
